@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Refund Policy";
}

<section class="py-5 bg-white border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Refund & Returns Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Learn about our standard return window, restocking fees, and spares exchange policies.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container fs-7 text-muted" style="max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mb-3">1. Return Window</h5>
        <p>Unopened machinery items can be returned within 7 days from delivery. Original packaging, boxes, manuals, and accessories must be intact.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">2. Spare Parts Exceptions</h5>
        <p>Demolition hammer armatures, spinner coils, stator coils, carbon brushes, and electrical spare components are **non-refundable** once they have been unpacked or fitted into tools, owing to safety and voltage calibration concerns.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">3. Restocking Fee</h5>
        <p>Returned heavy-duty drilling machinery or sanders will incur a flat 10% restocking fee. Return transportation costs are the responsibility of the purchaser.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">4. Damage Claims</h5>
        <p>Any items received damaged during transit must be reported with proof (unboxing images/video) to our support desk email within 24 hours of delivery. Reconciliations will be processed after logistics analysis.</p>
    </div>
</section>
